# Addon source folder

Every addon under `Addons/<Name>/` keeps its code in `src/`. Configuration and media stay at the addon root.

## Root

- `<Name>.toc`
- `tkmm.config`
- `RELEASE.md`
- Icons and other media (`icon.png`, `icon.tga`)

## `src/`

- `Main.lua`
- Feature scripts (`JunkMaster.lua`, `JunkMasterPanel.lua`, …)
- Addon XML, when an addon has any

Do not put the TOC, `tkmm.config`, `RELEASE.md`, or icons inside `src/`.

Packaging copies workspace `Common/` to `Common/` beside `src/`. `Libs/` is copied the same way. Do not rename those files, do not put them inside `src/`, and do not copy them into the workspace addon by hand.

## TOC

List addon scripts with the `src` path. Vendored Common and Libs stay at the addon root, so their TOC lines do not use `src`.

```toc
## Interface: 16001
## Title: JunkMaster
## Version: 0.1.0

Common\DevMode.lua
Common\Logger.lua
src\Main.lua
src\JunkMaster.lua
```

```
Addons/JunkMaster/
  JunkMaster.toc
  tkmm.config
  RELEASE.md
  icon.png
  src/
    Main.lua
    JunkMaster.lua
```
